      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹88.48 (vs ₹98.08 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹88.48 (down from ₹98.08 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹5.50b (up 25% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹516.9m (down 11% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 9.4% (down from 13% in FY 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 1% per year whereas the company’s share price has remained flat.",
